| ---: | --------- | :--: | :--: | :--------: | :---: | :----: |
|    1 | ADD       | 0101 | 0011 |    1000    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    2 | SUB       | 1001 | 0100 |    0101    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    3 | AND       | 1010 | 1100 |    1000    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    4 | OR        | 1010 | 1100 |    1110    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    5 | XOR       | 1010 | 1100 |    0110    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    6 | NOT       | 1010 | 0000 |    0101    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    7 | INC       | 0111 | 0000 |    1000    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    8 | DEC       | 0111 | 0000 |    0110    |   0   |  PASS  |
|    9 | ADD       | 1111 | 0001 |    0000    |   1   |  PASS  |

All test cases pass successfully.

